  "document": {
    "abstract": "This document presents four YANG 1.1 modules -- three IETF modules and one supporting IANA module. The three IETF modules are \"ietf-tls-common\", \"ietf-tls-client\", and \"ietf-tls-server\". The \"ietf-tls-client\" and \"ietf-tls-server\" modules are the primary productions of this work, supporting the configuration and monitoring of TLS clients and servers. The IANA module is \"iana-tls-cipher-suite-algs\". This module defines YANG enumerations that provide support for an IANA-maintained algorithm registry.",
